But Joey Wheeler doesn't quit,

256
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:09,477
especially when he's up against
stuck-up rich punks like you.

257
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:13,180
Fine, this will all be over
soon enough. That's right.

258
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:15,640
As soon as I wipe you out, Kaiba.

259
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:18,538
This could be exactly what I needed.

260
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:23,100
Now I activate Pot of Greed,
Which lets me draw two cards.

261
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:26,008
I just hope these two
cards can help me out.

262
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:29,137
That's what I'm talking about.

263
00:16:29,220 --> 00:16:30,900
First, I activate this.

264
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:32,260
It's Grave Robber.

265
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:38,600
And now, I can take any magic card
I want from your graveyard. Oh, no.

266
00:16:38,980 --> 00:16:40,520
And I take this.

267
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,000
Enemy Controller.

268
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:45,520
This is the magic card you
used against me before.

269
00:16:45,940 --> 00:16:49,352
You entered a command code and
took control of my monster.

270
00:16:52,020 --> 00:16:56,255
But I'm gonna use a slightly different
command code than you did, Kyber.

271
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:57,350
What?

272
00:16:57,433 --> 00:17:00,080
You still have to pay 1,000 life points.

273
00:17:00,420 --> 00:17:03,300
Up, left, down, right, A.

274
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:07,091
Now instead of controlling you,
monster, I can destroy you.

275
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:10,417
You can't.

276
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,265
Say goodbye to your blue eyes.

277
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:17,460
If I were you, I'd keep those eyes closed.

278
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:20,637
Because I'm gonna play
Monster Reborn. You what?

279
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,680
Now I'll bring back a monster.

280
00:17:23,360 --> 00:17:26,184
It's the same one I just
sent to your graveyard.

281
00:17:26,580 --> 00:17:27,960
My blue eyes!

282
00:17:28,660 --> 00:17:30,660
Yeah, man, I knew you could do it.

283
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:32,260
Now that was impressive.

284
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:34,402
Kaiba's in some serious trouble.

285
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:35,750
Seto.

286
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:42,740
Now, blue-eyes white dragon, attack
his blade knife with white lightning!

287
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:47,680
You'll regret that, Wheeler.

288
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:52,217
I'll start wrapping things up
by playing Hayabusa Knight in

289
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:56,540
defense mode Then I'll play
this card Face down on the field

290
00:17:57,120 --> 00:18:00,897
And that's gonna end my
turn Like that? You know,

291
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:05,437
the way I took your favorite card from
you It looks good standing here behind me,

292
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:06,350
doesn't it?

293
00:18:06,433 --> 00:18:07,263
Wheeler,

294
00:18:07,346 --> 00:18:09,737
you made a big mistake
by taking my blue eyes

295
00:18:09,820 --> 00:18:13,180
away from me Now it's time
for me to end this duel

296
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:18,157
This is unacceptable
There's no way I'll allow a

297
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:21,299
third-rate duelist like
Wheeler to use my Blue Eyes.

298
00:18:22,820 --> 00:18:27,080
Are you aware of the special ability
of my Kaiser Seahorse, Wheeler?

299
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:30,968
All I have to do to activate it
is send him to the graveyard.

300
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:36,220
Then I can summon a light attribute
monster from my hand directly to the field.

301
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:38,160
So, what's your point?

302
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:40,840
I sacrifice my Kaiser Seahorse.

303
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:44,780
So, I can summon Blue Eyes White Dragon!

304
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:55,560
Now we each have one.

305
00:18:58,440 --> 00:19:00,780
It's his blue eyes against mine.

306
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:02,540
Blue eyes, attack now!

307
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:09,260
There's no way I'll let
you control my monster.

308
00:19:15,060 --> 00:19:16,960
