310
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:24,380
I'm afraid I'm not through yet.

311
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:29,120
It's time to welcome my friend
back to the field now. With what?

312
00:19:29,860 --> 00:19:31,120
Monster reborn.

313
00:19:31,460 --> 00:19:35,020
Now my blue-eyes white
dragon, return to the field!

314
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:42,380
I'm the only one with the skills
necessary to wield a blue eyes!

315
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:45,677
Now it's time for me to
use my dragon to finish

316
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:49,600
